      "subject": "נתנים נתנים",
      "rationale": "Puo e pheti-phetoang — ”ba filoe ba filoe” — kahlolo e phahamiswang ke pheti e reng ba filwe ka botlalo; tlhaho ya Sesotho e boloka karolo ea kahlolo ka ”ka botlalo” e le bohlale bo phahamiswang ke pheti."
    },
    {
      "kind": "substitution",
      "subject": "ya butswitseng mpa",
      "rationale": "פטרת = se-butswi sa mpa, se tlokotsing se butswitseng; ”ya butswitseng” hase tlhaho ea moelelo oa motheo, o bolokilweng ka ”butswa” (to open)."
    },
    {
      "kind": "addition",
      "subject": "bana ba Levi",
      "rationale": "Sesotho se hlokahalang ho ⟨אתם⟩ — Lesotho e hlokahala, Lentsoe la Sebele le sa fumanehe."
    }
  ],
  "translation": "Hobane ba filoe ka botlalo, ba filoe ho ya ho ka hara bana ba Yisraele, ba filwe ho eena; bokgutshwane ba moo, ba ne ba sebeleha ho fihlela ho ya pela lebitso la Yahwe Tsebaote.",
